<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Recipe>
  <Description type="Sputtering">
    <Title>Textbook Ex05: DC Si Sputtering in Pure Ar (120 s)</Title>
    <Author>APS Control Community</Author>
    <Created>2026-11-25</Created>
    <Modified>2026-11-25</Modified>
    <Notes>Pre-sputters Si (PSU_A, 250 mA DC) for 120 s in 20 sccm Ar1 at 2 mTorr (V2, V6, M1), deposits 120 s onto Si with shutter retract to Home, then powers off and opens TC1 before zeroing Ar1.</Notes>
  </Description>
  <Parameters />
  <Script>
valve M1 open
valve V2 open
valve V6 open
mfc Ar1 20
pwait 2mT 300
set PSU_A Current 250
power PSU_A on
wait 120
holder Si
deposit Si 120 Home
holder Home
power PSU_A off
set PSU_A Current 0
pwait 0 1
mfc Ar1 0
valve V2 close
valve V6 close
valve M1 close
  </Script>
</Recipe>
